    npx:embeds sub:maintained-templates-view;
    npx:hasNanopubType gen:ResourceView;
    npx:introduces <https://w3id.org/np/RAHokSK-M65XoTWcufOQWbwJR4mOShe5SB-JttP3Xjg4I/maintained-templates-view-kind>;
    npx:supersedes <https://w3id.org/np/RAaBBRHQXJGvSlJJ-Njdj8EB_VmVZImJMlU0nxVYsgxqU>;
    skos:changeNote "Both list actions now use the template-specific \"Listing a template as a maintained resource\", which fixes the resource type and assigns the Maintained template preset in the same nanopublication, so a newly listed template gets its standard views at once; the register_type mapping and the corresponding query column are dropped.";
